  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "2. In a large bowl, crumble the Golden Dutch cheese and mix with the crisp breadcrumbs.",
    "3. Add the roast onions, Bryndza cheese, eggs, salt, and black pepper to the bowl and mix well.",
    "4. Using your hands, shape the mixture into small patties.",
    "5. Place the patties on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "6. Bake in the preheated oven for 15-20 minutes, or until golden brown and crispy.",
    "7. Serve hot and enjoy!"
